<title>FRANCE: Alcatel Alsthom in two Indonesia cable veNTURES.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Alsthom in two Indonesia cable veNTURES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said on Thursday it had signed two cable venture deals, one with PT Telecomunikasi Indonesia and another with Indonesian PT Elektrindo Nusantara and Japan's Tomen Corp.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the former was to produce optical fibre land cables and would start production from its base in Jakarta in 1998.</p>
<p>The second venture is for installation and maintenance of submarine cables, with a cable-laying vessel based in Java.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
